The field is **`topic`**.

In the code at lines 210-216, buildMainPage() accesses `n.topic` and then splits it on '/':

```typescript
const topic = n.topic;
if (!topic) {
  uncategorized.push(n);
  continue;
}
const segments = topic.split('/');
const project = segments[0];
const feature = segments[1] || '_general';
```

The first segment becomes the project name, and the second segment becomes the feature name (defaulting to `'_general'` if absent).
